    "formal": "\\text{IsOperatorStable}(d, \\phi) \\iff \\exists A_n, b_n: \\phi(A_n^\\top \\xi)^n = \\phi(\\xi) \\cdot e^{i\\langle b_n, \\xi\\rangle}",
    "plain": "Can the Gnedenko-Kolmogorov domain of attraction theory be generalized to R^d using matrix normalizations A_n = n^{-E}?",
